# The same running turn at 24 columns, where 2.1.259 keeps the elapsed time in
# the parenthesis and drops the detail after it. A different part of the tail
# survives at each width, so the spinner is not recognised by the tail.
print ● Finagling… (2s)
print ────────────────────────
print ❯
print ────────────────────────
print   ⏵⏵ auto mode on
sleep 600000
